# Live Order → SharedUI (remember)

## Goal
Mother Live Order look is the source of truth. SharedUI board; Mother + Client same chrome. Hosts own data + navigation.

## SharedUI (look + interaction chrome)
- Filter strip: **All / Collection / Delivery / Table** (Mother green selected style)
- Card chrome: size, border, title, `#order`, total, time
- Empty states via `LiveOrderSampleData.EmptyTextFor` (“No open local/collection/delivery orders”, “No active table sessions”)
- Optional badge row (e.g. WEB / CASH DUE) — host supplies text; SharedUI only draws
- Safe FlexLayout child remove (`SafeFlexLayout` — no `Children.Clear()`)

## Host-owned (data + navigation)

| | Mother | Client |
|--|--|--|
| Load | MySQL + table sessions | SQLite first, then Mother `GET /api/client/orders` |
| Refresh | `AppDataRefreshService` (no Refresh button) | WS + quiet ~45s sync; Refresh optional / host-only |
| Open card | `OrderPlacementPageSimple` | Online `OrderPage` via Mother |
| Header/shell | Mother `TopBar` | Client header / MainPage shell |
| Table tab | Active **sessions** | Open **table orders** (unless later session API) |

Same UI shell; different pipes. Pattern: `RestaurantTablesView` / `LoyaltyView`.

## Build order
1. SharedUI board + models + cards ✅
2. Mother thin host ✅
3. Client `MainPage` ✅
4. Client `LiveOrderPage` ✅
5. Polish & QA ✅ checklist below (manual run ← next)

## Phase 5 polish
- FlexLayout: both hosts only mutate cards via `LiveOrderBoardView.SetCards` → `SafeFlexLayout` ✅
- Fingerprint skip: Client MainPage + Client `LiveOrderPage` + Mother host ✅
- Empty copy: “open” not “unpaid” (lifecycle/sent board) ✅
- Theme `Ow*` tokens: deferred (Mother hex kept for v1)

## Non-goals (v1)
- Do **not** move Mother MySQL or Client HTTP into SharedUI
- Do **not** force Client Table tab to sessions without Mother session list API
- Do **not** push Mother web cash-due onto Client until `GET /api/client/orders` expands
- Do **not** redesign Mother TopBar / Client header into the shared board

## QA checklist (manual)
1. Mother: All / Collection / Delivery / Table — empty + with orders; tap → Order Place / table session
2. Mother: web cash-due shows WEB / CASH DUE badges when present
3. Client: same tab look; open Collection / Delivery / Table order online
4. Client: offline refuse open; Live Order still paints from cache
5. Client: WS / silent sync updates board without flash/toast when warm
6. Side-by-side: Mother vs Client tabs + cards match (Table data meaning may differ)

## Client known difference
Table tab = open table-type **orders**, not Mother table sessions.
